---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Settings"
description: "Tune the typing experience, manage profiles, export or import your data."
---
<div class="toc-host" data-toc-root>
{% include "partials/page-toc.njk" %}
<header class="page__head">
  <h1>Settings</h1>
  <p class="page__subtitle">All settings persist in localStorage on this device.</p>
</header>

<section class="settings">
  <div class="settings__group settings-card">
    <header class="settings-card__head">
      <h2>Profile</h2>
      <p class="settings-card__sub">Multiple profiles per device — all your data is scoped to the active profile.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="settings-card__field">
      <label for="profile-select" class="settings-card__label">Active profile</label>
      <select id="profile-select" class="settings-card__select"></select>
    </div>

    <div class="settings-card__actions" role="group" aria-label="Profile actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="profile-add">+ New profile</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="profile-rename">Rename</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="profile-delete">Delete</button>
    </div>

    <hr class="settings-card__rule">

    <div class="settings-card__backup">
      <div class="settings-card__backup-text">
        <h3>Backup &amp; transfer</h3>
        <p class="settings-card__sub">Move your stats and profiles between devices. Everything stays on your device until you export it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="settings-card__backup-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" id="profile-export">Export JSON</button>
        <label class="btn btn--small" for="profile-import">Import JSON</label>
        <input id="profile-import" type="file" accept="application/json" hidden>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="settings-card__quota">
      <div class="settings-card__quota-bar"><div class="settings-card__quota-fill" id="quota-fill"></div></div>
      <p class="settings-card__quota-text" id="quota-hint"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Practice</h2>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="set-language">Word list</label>
        <select id="set-language">
          {# Auto-populated from the wordlists registry so every list
             registered in src/_data/wordlists.js shows up here without
             a second source-of-truth. #}
          {% for w in wordlists %}
          <option value="{{ w.id }}">{{ w.name }}{% if w.flavor %} — {{ w.flavor }}{% endif %}</option>
          {% endfor %}
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">The pool the engine pulls from in <strong>time</strong>, <strong>words</strong>, and <strong>adaptive</strong> modes. English lists run 1k → 50k by frequency. Code lists draw from real syntax. Punctuation and Numbers are focused drills. <a href="/wordlists/">Browse the full lists →</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="set-layout">Keyboard layout (heatmap only)</label>
        <select id="set-layout">
          <option value="qwerty">QWERTY</option>
          <option value="dvorak">Dvorak</option>
          <option value="colemak">Colemak</option>
          <option value="workman">Workman</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">Only changes the visual layout of the heatmap on the stats page. The engine reads <code>KeyboardEvent.key</code> directly from your OS, so typing already uses your real layout — no need to tell it.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-typingFont">Typing font</label>
        <select id="pref-typingFont">
          <option value="jetbrains-mono">JetBrains Mono — default</option>
          <option value="fira-code">Fira Code — popular for code</option>
          <option value="ibm-plex-mono">IBM Plex Mono — humanist, warmer</option>
          <option value="iosevka">Iosevka — narrow, fits more per line</option>
          <option value="cascadia-code">Cascadia Code — Microsoft&#39;s terminal font</option>
          <option value="roboto-mono">Roboto Mono — neutral, familiar</option>
          <option value="source-code-pro">Source Code Pro — Adobe classic</option>
          <option value="ubuntu-mono">Ubuntu Mono — softer geometry</option>
          <option value="space-mono">Space Mono — quirky, geometric</option>
          <option value="inconsolata">Inconsolata — slim, elegant</option>
          <option value="cousine">Cousine — Courier successor</option>
          <option value="system">System mono — your OS default (no download)</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">Font used in the typing surface only. Other surfaces stay in Inter / Lora. <strong>System mono</strong> downloads nothing at all.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="set-caret">Caret style</label>
        <select id="set-caret">
          <option value="line">Line — thin vertical bar</option>
          <option value="block">Block — solid rectangle over the next char</option>
          <option value="underline">Underline — thin bar under the next char</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">Visual style of the cursor in the typing surface.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Allow forward typing past errors<span class="field__hint">When on, you can keep typing after a mistake (the wrong char is marked red and you move on). When off, the cursor refuses to advance until you fix it.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="set-freedom"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Show live wpm during test<span class="field__hint">Updates the WPM number in the toolbar in real time. Turn off if you find the changing number distracting.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="set-live-wpm"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Smooth caret motion<span class="field__hint">Animates the caret between characters. Off = instant jumps for lower latency.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="set-smooth-caret"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Typing assists</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 var(--space-3)">Behavioral toggles that change how the engine reacts to errors and spacing. All persist per profile.</p>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Stop cursor on error<span class="field__hint">Cursor refuses to advance until you hit the right key.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-stopOnError"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Forgive errors<span class="field__hint">Auto-correct trivial mistypes (off-by-one near-miss, swapped adjacent letters).</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-forgiveErrors"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Space skips words<span class="field__hint">Pressing space mid-word jumps the cursor to the start of the next word.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-spaceSkipsWords"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Ignore capitalization<span class="field__hint">Treat <code>A</code> and <code>a</code> as equivalent — useful when shift fatigue distorts your real wpm.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-ignoreCapitalization"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Skip punctuation<span class="field__hint">Auto-skip <code>.</code> <code>,</code> <code>;</code> <code>:</code> <code>?</code> <code>!</code> <code>'</code> <code>"</code> in source text.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-skipPunctuation"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Visual aids</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 var(--space-3)">Optional overlays during practice. Default off.</p>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Show virtual keyboard<span class="field__hint">SVG keyboard below the surface highlights the next-expected key in accent color.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-showVirtualKeyboard"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Tap-to-type keyboard (mobile)<span class="field__hint">On phones, replaces the OS soft keyboard with a built-in one. No autocorrect, no predictive text — every keystroke is exactly what you tap.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-mobileKeyboard"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Color-code keyboard by finger<span class="field__hint">Tints each key with its finger's color, adds a legend strip, and pulses the next-expected key. Requires the virtual keyboard to be on.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-keyboardFingerColors"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Show ticker<span class="field__hint">Strip below the surface pulses green/red per keystroke and shows rolling 5-second WPM.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-showTicker"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Hide UI<span class="field__hint">Hide the toolbar + actions during a session for distraction-free typing.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-hideUI"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Hide practice toolbar<span class="field__hint">Just hides the mode/length toolbar above the typing surface. Live stats and the rest of the UI stay. Implied when "Hide UI" is on.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-hideToolbar"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Auto-scroll<span class="field__hint">Auto-scroll the typing surface to keep the caret centered.</span></span>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="pref-autoScroll"><span class="toggle__track"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-whitespaceMark">Whitespace mark</label>
        <select id="pref-whitespaceMark">
          <option value="none" selected>None — clean, no marker</option>
          <option value="bar">Bar — small underbar</option>
          <option value="bullet">Bullet — • centered dot</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">How spaces render in the typing surface.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Reporting cadence</h2>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-reportFrequency">Update WPS / accuracy every</label>
        <select id="pref-reportFrequency">
          <option value="word" selected>Word — refresh after every word</option>
          <option value="line">Line — refresh once per line break</option>
          <option value="page">Page — refresh only at end of session</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">How often the live numbers in the toolbar refresh.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Sound</h2>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-soundTheme">Sound theme</label>
        <select id="pref-soundTheme">
          <option value="off" selected>Off — silent</option>
          <option value="click">Click — soft mechanical</option>
          <option value="typewriter">Typewriter — vintage</option>
          <option value="pop">Pop — quick percussive</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">Per-keystroke audio feedback.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-soundVolume">Volume</label>
        <input type="range" id="pref-soundVolume" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="50">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Theme</h2>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Light / dark<span class="field__hint">Quick toggle for the warm-paper light and deep-ocean dark defaults.</span></span>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" onclick="window.toggleTheme && window.toggleTheme()">Toggle</button>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pref-themePreset">Preset</label>
        <select id="pref-themePreset">
          <option value="">Default — warm paper / deep ocean</option>
          <option value="solarized-dark">Solarized Dark</option>
          <option value="solarized-light">Solarized Light</option>
          <option value="dracula">Dracula</option>
          <option value="nord">Nord</option>
          <option value="gruvbox-dark">Gruvbox Dark</option>
          <option value="one-dark">One Dark</option>
          <option value="tokyo-night">Tokyo Night</option>
          <option value="catppuccin">Catppuccin Mocha</option>
          <option value="rose-pine">Rose Pine</option>
          <option value="github-dark">GitHub Dark</option>
          <option value="github-light">GitHub Light</option>
        </select>
        <span class="field__hint">Switch the entire color palette. Selecting a preset overrides the light/dark toggle.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Custom theme</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 var(--space-3)">Build your own palette. Changes apply live; save when you like what you see.</p>
    <div class="theme-builder" id="theme-builder">
      <div class="theme-builder__grid">
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Background</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--bg-0" value="#14161e">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Surface</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--bg-1" value="#1c1f29">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Raised</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--bg-2" value="#252834">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Text</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--fg-0" value="#ecedef">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Muted text</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--fg-2" value="#9ba0a8">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Accent</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--accent" value="#e58060">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Success</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--good" value="#5fb878">
        </label>
        <label class="theme-builder__swatch">
          <span>Error</span>
          <input type="color" data-token="--bad" value="#c0392b">
        </label>
      </div>

      <p class="theme-builder__warn" id="theme-builder-warn" hidden></p>

      <div class="theme-builder__preview" aria-label="Live preview">
        <p>"<em>The quick brown fox</em>" -- preview text in the chosen palette.</p>
        <div class="theme-builder__preview-row">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--primary">Primary</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--small">Default</button>
          <span class="theme-builder__pill theme-builder__pill--good">good</span>
          <span class="theme-builder__pill theme-builder__pill--bad">error</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theme-builder__actions">
        <input type="text" id="theme-builder-name" maxlength="40" placeholder="Theme name" class="theme-builder__name">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--primary" id="theme-builder-save">Save theme</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="theme-builder-reset">Reset preview</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" id="theme-builder-export">Copy JSON</button>
      </div>

      <div class="theme-builder__import">
        <label for="theme-builder-paste">Paste a theme JSON to import</label>
        <textarea id="theme-builder-paste" rows="2" placeholder='{"name":"My theme","tokens":{"--bg-0":"#14161e",...}}'></textarea>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="theme-builder-import">Import</button>
      </div>

      <div class="theme-builder__saved" id="theme-builder-saved" hidden>
        <h3>Your themes</h3>
        <ul id="theme-builder-saved-list"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="settings__group">
    <h2>Danger zone</h2>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Reset model (clear per-key + bigram data, keep sessions)</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="reset-model">Reset model</button>
    </div>
    <div class="settings__row">
      <span>Clear all data on this device</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" id="reset-all">Clear all</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
